{"html":"<p>A shortener looks trivial and is not: it is a hot-path read, a write with\ncontention, a cache with invalidation, and a rate limiter that must not fall over\nunder a burst.</p>\n<p><strong>What it is:</strong> <code>POST /links</code> returns a 7-character code; <code>GET /{code}</code> redirects\nin under a millisecond from cache; <code>/stats</code> shows hit rates and p99 latency.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-learn\">What you learn</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Skill</th>\n<th>Where it comes from</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Async web plumbing</td>\n<td>axum extractors, <code>tower</code> layers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL that is safe and fast</td>\n<td>sqlx compile-checked queries, indexes, <code>EXPLAIN</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Caching with invalidation</td>\n<td><code>moka</code> or a Redis client, TTL, stampede control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backpressure</td>\n<td>concurrency limits, connection pool sizing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Load testing</td>\n<td><code>oha</code>/<code>k6</code>, p99 not average</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"milestones\">Milestones</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>Ship</th>\n<th>Done when</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Redirect from a hashmap</td>\n<td><code>GET /abc</code> → 302, in memory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Persist to Postgres</td>\n<td>links survive a restart</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Add caching</td>\n<td>repeat reads hit cache, not the DB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Rate limit writes</td>\n<td>429 after N per minute per IP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Measure</td>\n<td>10k req/s locally, p99 &#x3C; 5 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Harden</td>\n<td>graceful shutdown, timeouts, <code>/readyz</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"schema\">Schema</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"sql\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> links</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    code        </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">TEXT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    owner_id    </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(),</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    hits        </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">CREATE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> idx_links_owner</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> ON</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> links (owner_id, created_at </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">DESC</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>code</code> as the primary key means the hot read is a primary-key lookup — no second\nindex, no join. The counter lives in the same row; updating it on every redirect\nwould serialise writes, so increment it in batches from a background task.</p>\n<h2 id=\"handlers\">Handlers</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> axum</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    extract</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Path</span><span style=\"--