DBAC7\">(limiter) }))</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">with_state</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(state);</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Apply it to <strong>writes only</strong>. Rate-limiting redirects turns your CDN into a 429\nmachine the moment a link goes viral.</p>\n<h2 id=\"measure-before-you-optimise\">Measure before you optimise</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> oha</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -z</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 30s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> http://localhost:8080/abc123</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Read p99 and the error rate, not the mean. Then profile:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> flamegraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --bin</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> linkforge</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>The usual findings, in order: <code>println!</code> logging in the hot path, a fresh\n<code>reqwest::Client</code> per request, pool exhaustion (<code>acquire_timeout</code> errors), and\n<code>format!</code> in the redirect path.</p>\n<h2 id=\"stretch-goals\">Stretch goals</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom slugs with reserved-word blocking.</li>\n<li>Click analytics: aggregate in a <code>link_hits</code> table, roll up hourly.</li>\n<li>Expiring links (<code>expires_at</code>, filtered in the query, cleaned by a worker).</li>\n<li>A/B redirects: same code, two targets, sticky by cookie.</li>\n<li>Deploy it: multi-stage Docker image, 3 replicas behind a load balancer.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"demo-checklist\">Demo checklist</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> <code>oha</code> output showing p99 under 5 ms at 10k req/s</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> cache hit ratio in <code>/metrics</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> 429 from the rate limiter, with <code>Retry-After</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled> a graceful restart with zero dropped requests</li>\n</ul>"}